The DVI link handler (src/link/dvi/) implements the OBDX Pro binary protocol
as described in the vendor's published documentation. OBDX and OBDX Pro,
OBDLink and STN, ELM327, Dragy and Vgate are trademarks of their respective
owners; the names appear here only to identify supported hardware.

The fixtures under mock_data/ are adapter transcripts captured from real
vehicles. Every VIN and calibration id in them has been replaced with a
synthetic value (tools/synthesize_fixtures.py); no fixture identifies a
specific vehicle.
